<!--
  12  EDGE CASES                                    settings: defaults

  Check:
  - Names with accents, other scripts, dots, hyphens, and underscores are
    colored (all orange, under the red root).
  - Things that only look like tags are not colored: "< spaced>", "<1bad>",
    "<>", and "<-dash>".
  - A closing tag with a space before ">" (</item >) still pairs up.
  - Many tags on one line are colored and pair up correctly.
  - The <unfinished tag at the very end has no ">". It is still colored,
    and it's UNDERLINED as never closed.
  - Empty the whole file (Ctrl+A, Delete) and undo: no errors, colors return.
-->
